[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/5930548255","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-5930548255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":5930548255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABYXz8Hw","user":{"login":"v-dunjadenic","id":262324666,"node_id":"U_kgDOD6LBug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262324666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic","html_url":"https://github.com/v-dunjadenic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-dunjadenic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T11:39:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T11:39:52Z","body":"Thanks for flagging this @whysosuresh, we're aware of this issue and are currently working on the case that you mentioned as part of follow up for https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14594. We'll keep this issue open for tracking purposes so that users are aware of any future changes landing. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/5930548255/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6340151549","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6340151549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6340151549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABeecI_Q","user":{"login":"Zordrak","id":151241,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTI0MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151241?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak","html_url":"https://github.com/Zordrak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zordrak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T11:57:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:57:12Z","body":"Same on `ubuntu-26.04`. On 22 October this failed three runs of one commit of ours, on westus and westus3 runners, and each time a job lost all three of its install attempts. The index always came down at full speed (`Fetched 2799 kB in 1s (4952 kB/s)`), then the archive download from azure.archive.ubuntu.com crawled until our 120s per-attempt limit killed it. No `Err:` or `Ign:` lines, and apt never tried archive.ubuntu.com, the second entry in `/etc/apt/apt-mirrors.txt`. The repo is private so I can't link the logs, but the windows were 10:29-10:36, 11:12-11:19 and 11:35-11:47 UTC.\n\nIn case it helps anyone else waiting on this: after a stalled attempt we now delete the azure.archive.ubuntu.com line from `/etc/apt/apt-mirrors.txt` before retrying, so the retry goes straight to archive.ubuntu.com. We'd happily take that back out once the image handles a slow node.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6340151549/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6349625230","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6349625230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6349625230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABeneXjg","user":{"login":"gtjoseph","id":1205666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDU2NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1205666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph","html_url":"https://github.com/gtjoseph","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T19:38:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T19:38:26Z","body":"This is absolutely killing us.  So far today, we've had half a dozen jobs timeout after 15 minutes because of hung package installs.  When it runs normally, an apt update followed by install takes about 40 seconds.  This morning it was 2 minutes, 5 minutes, 8 minutes plus the 6 timeouts.  The worst part is that when this happens in private repos we create for security advisories, those minutes come out of our free allotment.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6349625230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6368234147","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6368234147","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6368234147,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABe5OKow","user":{"login":"kdeyarmin","id":256666127,"node_id":"U_kgDOD0xqDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256666127?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin","html_url":"https://github.com/kdeyarmin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-23T15:17:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:17:28Z","body":"Unsubscribe and delete ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6368234147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6368983010","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6368983010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6368983010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABe5734g","user":{"login":"kdeyarmin","id":256666127,"node_id":"U_kgDOD0xqDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256666127?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin","html_url":"https://github.com/kdeyarmin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdeyarmin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-23T15:54:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:54:23Z","body":"Close this ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6368983010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6374850791","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6374850791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6374850791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABe_iA5w","user":{"login":"woodruffw","id":3059210,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTkyMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3059210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw","html_url":"https://github.com/woodruffw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woodruffw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-23T21:13:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T21:13:21Z","body":"This is causing a lot of problems for runners that fetch even relatively small packages via APT: one of our recent runs on [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) spent over 7 minutes(!) trying to download a file that was less than 20 MB. \n\nIs there a timeline for a fix here? It's been very disruptive for us.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6374850791/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6431629181","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6431629181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6431629181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABf1rffQ","user":{"login":"mschfh","id":37435502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDM1NTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37435502?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh","html_url":"https://github.com/mschfh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschfh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:41:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:41:58Z","body":"This seems to happen mostly in `westus3`.\n\nEach region has a local LB:\n```\nazure.archive.ubuntu.com. 7\tIN\tCNAME\tubuntu-archive-asm.trafficmanager.net.\nubuntu-archive-asm.trafficmanager.net. 112 IN CNAME cloud-mirror-lb.southcentralus.cloudapp.azure.com.\ncloud-mirror-lb.southcentralus.cloudapp.azure.com. 7 IN\tA 40.119.46.219\n\nazure.archive.ubuntu.com. 2\tIN\tCNAME\tubuntu-archive-asm.trafficmanager.net.\nubuntu-archive-asm.trafficmanager.net. 125 IN CNAME cloud-mirror-lb.westus3.cloudapp.azure.com.\ncloud-mirror-lb.westus3.cloudapp.azure.com. 8 IN A 20.106.104.242\n```\n\nThe mirror in `eastus` or `southcentralus` serves packages locally, while `westus3` requests are proxied through squid:\n\n```\nX-Cache: MISS from 192.168.0.8\nX-Cache-Lookup: MISS from 192.168.0.8:8000\nVia: 1.1 192.168.0.8 (squid/5.2)\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/mschfh/github-actions-apt-mirror-benchmark/actions/runs/40431922006/job/121951410354#step:9:505\nhttps://github.com/mschfh/github-actions-apt-mirror-benchmark/actions/runs/40431982958/job/121951606563#step:9:454\n\n\nSo far I haven’t seen any cache hits, which makes me wonder whether the proxy is configured correctly.\nEither way, this seems to point to something on the Azure infrastructure side.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6431629181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6447754722","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6447754722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6447754722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABgFDt4g","user":{"login":"v-davit-ioramashvili","id":294214454,"node_id":"U_kgDOEYlbNg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294214454?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili","html_url":"https://github.com/v-davit-ioramashvili","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-davit-ioramashvili/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:39:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:39:51Z","body":"From #15142 and our probes on 2026-10-27: the westus and westus3 endpoints (`cloud-mirror-lb.westus.cloudapp.azure.com`, `cloud-mirror-lb.westus3.cloudapp.azure.com`) serve archives at 40–75 kB/s from every runner region we tried, while the other regional endpoints serve at 20–90 MB/s. One reporter went from 0 to 21 of 24 timeouts in westus3 starting 2026-10-26.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6447754722/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/comments/6451665788","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14823#issuecomment-6451665788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/runner-images/issues/14823","id":6451665788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC1mGT88AAAABgIybfA","user":{"login":"flotter-cs","id":240519098,"node_id":"U_kgDODlYHug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240519098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs","html_url":"https://github.com/flotter-cs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flotter-cs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":